Approvals
Who decides each checkpoint, and how auto matched you

╭──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
│ Full auto                                                                                                                                                    off: each checkpoint keeps its own mode │
│ ❯ For every checkpoint        off                      built-in             Full auto for every checkpoint a run opens                                                                               │
│   Who answers questions       GPT 5.6 on Codex         everywhere (global)  Who answers the crew's questions in your place                                                                           │
