│                                                                                                                                                                                                      │
│ Who checks                                                                                                                                                   the cheapest model from another company │
│   Approver model              cheapest, other company  built-in             The approver model, any model in the registry                                                                            │
│   Second approver             none, one approver       built-in             A second approver, from another vendor, that must also approve                                                           │
│                                                                                                                                                                                                      │
│ Plan · auto · rules and approver both agree                                                                                                                            0 matches in a row · 0 misses │
│   How it's decided            auto                     everywhere (global)  The plan checkpoint: supervised waits for you, shadow also records what auto would do, auto lets your settings decide    │
│   Who decides in auto         both agree               built-in             The plan checkpoint: who decides in auto mode, your rules, your approver model, or both                                  │
│   When auto doesn't approve   ask you                  built-in             The plan checkpoint: what happens when auto doesn't approve                                                              │
│   Hard limit in full auto     stop safely              built-in             The plan checkpoint: what a hard limit does in full auto                                                                 │
│   Judge's widest score gap    1.0                      built-in             Plan rules: the largest gap between one judge's two scores, out of 10                                                    │
│                                                                                                                                                                                                      │
│ Merge · auto · your rules decide                                                                                                                                       0 matches in a row · 0 misses │
│   How it's decided            auto                     everywhere (global)  The merge checkpoint: supervised waits for you, shadow also records what auto would do, auto lets your settings decide   │
│   Who decides in auto         your rules               built-in             The merge checkpoint: who decides in auto mode, your rules, your approver model, or both                                 │
│   When auto doesn't approve   ask you                  built-in             The merge checkpoint: what happens when auto doesn't approve                                                             │
│   Hard limit in full auto     stop safely              built-in             The merge checkpoint: what a hard limit does in full auto                                                                │
│   Merge with unreviewed debt  no                       built-in             Merge rules: whether auto may merge a card whose debt no strong enough model reviewed                                    │
